#: ../../getting_started/installation.rst:91
msgid ""
":mod:`~qilisdk.backends.cudaq_backend.CudaqBackend` and "
":mod:`~qilisdk.backends.qutip_backend.QutipBackend` run on third-party "
"frameworks that QiliSDK does not distribute, so they are not covered by "
